Dialdeck third-party open source (runtime)

- LiveKit server and JS SDK — Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/livekit/livekit
- Pion WebRTC (via LiveKit) — MIT — https://github.com/pion/webrtc
- RNNoise — BSD-3-Clause — https://gitlab.xiph.org/xiph/rnnoise
- Jitsi rnnoise-wasm — Apache-2.0 / BSD — https://github.com/jitsi/rnnoise-wasm
- dtln-rs (optional) — Apache-2.0 — Datadog
- Postgres — PostgreSQL License
- Redis — RSALv2 / SPDX as shipped by image
- MinIO — GNU AGPLv3
- Caddy — Apache-2.0
- coturn — BSD-3-Clause
- React, Vite, Fastify — MIT
- emoji-mart / emojibase — MIT / various

No proprietary noise, GIF, or media SDK is required to run Dialdeck.
GIF search providers (Klipy, Giphy) are optional and disabled by default.
